<Description>the slot offset (in slots) allocated to CSI-RS transmission in each CSI-RS transmission period.</Description>
<HideCondition>0==sum(CSIRS_Enable)</HideCondition>
<Validate><T>Int</T><D>13</D></Validate></Item>
<Item XName="CellID" Type="PartParam">
<DataEntry>=CellID</DataEntry>
